  category: 0
  detail: "\tUse 1 action to enter a frenzy mode for 2 turns. While in this mode,
    gain the following additional effects:   \t1. When attacking and hitting a target,
    add extra damage equal to your STR Modifier.   \t2. When attacking, roll an additional
    Hit Dice based on the attack's Hit Dice and include it in the calculation.  "
